  <p>A data-driven review of question volume, question-type mix, and recurring content patterns in the BIEK HSC Part-2 Computer Science question bank.</p>
</header>
<main>
<section id="overview">
  <h2>Dataset & Examination Overview</h2>
  <p>The dataset contains <strong>{len(rows)} extracted questions</strong> from BIEK Computer Science HSC Part-2 past papers. The data file contains records for <strong>{len(present_years)} examination years</strong>: {', '.join(map(str, present_years))}. Although the documented scope is 2015–2025, <strong>2020 is not present in <code>data.csv</code></strong>; all trend calculations below therefore use only years actually present in the file.</p>
  <div class="grid kpis">
